2) Eartigo - Part A Questions

This document answers the following questions:- 
The team's data inventory must answer the following questions for every data type:
What data is collected?
Why is it collected? (purpose)
Where is it stored? (database, cloud bucket, third-party)
Who can access it? (role, department)
How long is it retained? (retention policy)
Is it shared with any third party?
Does it cross India's borders? (data localisation check)
Is consent captured for this specific use?

